  m_Name: GemMerchant_PostLevel2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  merchantTextLines:
  - "Ah, the flame grows brighter, and so does the crowd. Just don\u2019t let them
    drain <dangle a=.2>too many</dangle> of my gems."
  - "You\u2019re not done yet. The only path forward is deeper into <shake a=.4>The
    Lost Greens</shake>."
  - "There, you\u2019ll find <wave a=.2 f=1.5>The Watcher</wave>. She sees what others
    miss\u2026 and she\u2019ll <wiggle a=.05 f=2>strengthen</wiggle> your emberlings."
  - Go. And <slide a=.2>keep that fire of yours burning</slide>.
  showShopAfterDialog: 0
